@startuml jwt-sequence
title Cycle d'authentification JWT — zØmbie zØne

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantFontColor #000000
  ArrowFontColor #000000
  BoxLineColor #666666
  BoxBackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  NoteBorderColor #999999
  NoteFontColor #000000
}
skinparam titleFontColor #000000
skinparam titleFontSize 16

participant "Client\n(React SPA)" as C
participant "Backend\n(Express 5)" as B
database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma)" as DB

== Connexion ==

C -> B : POST /api/auth/login\n{ email, password }
B -> DB : findFirst({ where: { email } })
DB --> B : { id, email, passwordHash, role }
B -> B : argon2.verify(password, hash)
B -> B : generateAccessToken()\n(JWT, 15 min)
B -> B : generateRefreshToken()\n(UUID token_id + JWT, 7j)
B -> DB : INSERT RefreshToken\n{ userId, tokenId, hash(jwt) }
DB --> B : OK
B --> C : 200 OK  { success: true, data: { id, email } }\nSet-Cookie: accessToken (httpOnly, 15min)\nSet-Cookie: refreshToken (httpOnly, Path=/api/auth/refresh, 7j)

note over C : Aucun token en JS —\ncookies httpOnly uniquement

== Accès à une ressource protégée ==

C -> B : GET /api/orders/mine\n(cookie accessToken envoyé automatiquement)
B -> B : requireAuth middleware\njwt.verify(accessToken)
B --> C : 200 OK { success: true, data: [...] }

== Token expiré → Refresh automatique ==

C -> B : GET /api/orders/mine\n(accessToken expiré)
B -> B : jwt.verify() → TokenExpiredError
B --> C : 401 Unauthorized

note over C : apiFetch intercepte 401\n(promise singleton anti race-condition\nReact StrictMode)

C -> B : POST /api/auth/refresh\n(cookie refreshToken Path=/api/auth/refresh)
B -> DB : findFirst({ where: { userId } })\n+ argon2.verify(jwt, hash)
DB --> B : RefreshToken valide
B -> DB : DELETE ancien RefreshToken\n(rotation — révocation immédiate)
B -> DB : INSERT nouveau RefreshToken
DB --> B : OK
B -> B : generateAccessToken()\ngenerateRefreshToken()
B --> C : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: nouveaux accessToken + refreshToken

C -> B : GET /api/orders/mine (retry)\n(nouveau accessToken)
B --> C : 200 OK { success: true, data: [...] }

== Déconnexion ==

C -> B : POST /api/auth/logout\n(cookie refreshToken)
B -> DB : DELETE RefreshToken\n(révocation en base)
DB --> B : OK
B --> C : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: accessToken (MaxAge=0)\nSet-Cookie: refreshToken (MaxAge=0)

note over C : Cookies effacés —\ntoken révoqué en base

@enduml
